{"symbol":"MALPANI","yahoo":"MALPANI.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Malpani Pipes and Fittings Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","website":"https://www.malpanipipes.com","about":"Malpani Pipes and Fittings Limited manufactures and supplies high-grade plastic pipes in India. It offers high-density polyethylene (HDPE) pipes, medium-density polyethylene (MDPE) pipes, and linear low-density polyethylene (LLDPE) pipes under the Volstar brand name. The company also provides gas, drip irrigation, lateral, and PLB HDPE telecom ducts pipes; PVC pipes and fittings; and HDPE sprinkler pipes and fittings, and sewerage pipe. In addition, it engages in the trading of granules and PVC pipes, as well as sales of services. It sells its products to wholesalers, retailers, and farmers, as well as for government projects. Malpani Pipes and Fittings Limited was incorporated in 2017 and is based in Ratlam, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:58:20+00:00","quote":{"price":64.5,"prevClose":60.65,"marketCap":69.51,"high52":85.9,"low52":48.1,"pe":7.7,"bookValue":51.7,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":17.65,"shares":1.0777,"insiders":78.92,"institutions":0.12},"prices":{"dates":["2025-02-04","2025-02-05","2025-02-06","2025-02-07","2025-02-10","2025-02-11","2025-02-12","2025-02-13","2025-02-14","2025-02-17","2025-02-18","2025-02-19","2025-02-20","2025-02-21","2025-02-24","2025-02-25","2025-02-27","2025-02-28","2025-03-03","2025-03-04","2025-03-05","2025-03-06","2025-03-07","2025-03-10","2025-03-11","2025-03-12","2025-03-13","2025-03-17","2025-03-18","2025-03-19","2025-03-20","2025-03-21","2025-03-24","2025-03-25","2025-03-26","2025-03-27","2025-03-28","2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","2025-04-08","2025-04-09","2025-04-11","2025-04-15","2025-04-16","2025-04-17","2025-04-21","2025-04-22","2025-04-23","2025-04-24","2025-04-25","2025-04-28","2025-04-29","2025-04-30","2025-05-02","2025-05-05","2025-05-06","2025-05-07","2025-05-08